>Links

A short page whose only job is to have several links on screen at once, so Tab
has somewhere to go.

 `[The index`index.mu]
 `[About`about.mu]
 `[This page again`links.mu]

>>Off the edge

 The renderer records only the links inside the scroll window, exactly as the
 device hit-tests only what it can show. Scroll, then Tab reaches the rest.

`clinks.mu
